-- =============================================================================
-- 2026-08-27  Demo product catalog top-up — >=50 products per demo tenant
-- =============================================================================
-- WHY
-- ---
-- 2026-08-26_demo_tenants.demo.sql seeded 2-4 products per tenant -- enough to
-- prove the flows exist, not enough to exercise search, pagination, low-stock
-- filtering, or a realistic POS session. This tops every demo000% tenant up to
-- 55 products, stock_quantity randomised 50-100, reusing the categories
-- and store_id each tenant already has.
--
-- IDEMPOTENT: INSERT IGNORE with fixed IDs, continuing the pr-numbering from the
-- parent file (pr01-pr15) at pr100+ so there is no collision. Safe to re-run.
-- Same *.demo.sql suffix -- skipped by a plain `npm run migrate`, included by
-- `npm run migrate:demo` / reset-to-demo.js.
-- =============================================================================

